<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Samitri cut to reduce.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Samitri cut to reduce.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg said on Tuesday analyst J. Alberto Airas reduced his rating for Brazilian mining company Samitri to reduce from hold.</p>
<p>-- Samitri reported a 1996 profit of 0.94 real a share, lower than SBC Warburg's 1.13 reais estimate.</p>
<p>-- Airas set a 12-month price target of 30 reais a share.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
